<p>--Glenn Close - 101 Dalmations</p>
<p>--Madonna - Evita</p>
<p>--Frances McDormand - Fargo</p>
<p>--Debbie Reynolds - Mother</p>
<p>--Barbra Streisand - The Mirror Has Two Faces</p>
