<p>--Antonio Banderas - Evita</p>
<p>--Kevin Costner - Tin Cup</p>
<p>--Tom Cruise - Jerry Maguire</p>
<p>--Nathan Lane - The Birdcage</p>
<p>--Eddie Murphy - The Nutty Professor</p>
<p>BEST FOREIGN LANGUAGE FILM</p>
<p>--The Eighth Day (Belgium)</p>
<p>--Kolya (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>--Lune E L'Altra (Italy)</p>
<p>--Prisoner of the Mountains (Russia)</p>
<p>--Ridicule (France)</p>
