<p>--Juliette Binoche - The English Patient</p>
<p>--Barbara Hershey - The Portrait of a Lady</p>
<p>--Marianne Jean-Baptiste - Secrets &amp; Lies</p>
<p>--Marion Ross - The Evening Star</p>
